<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make a man of, make manly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς γεωργοῦντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					5.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in 
				Pass.
			 or 
				Med.
			, <i>come to manhood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				744
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				228
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>play the man,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.3.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				151d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1115b4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				16.13
			</span></i>; <i>dress like a man,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> sens. obsc.,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				79.5
			</span></i>; of a eunuch, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπὶ γυναῖκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.37
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.</u>
				54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				4.1
			</span></i>.</div>
